            <a name="DESC">
            This auction is for a Top 10 SK on the Rodcet Nife Server.
 <br>
 <br>
 UNBUFFED hp is over 7.4k, 2300ac buffed. With max buffs and raid settings, you are a 10khp tank.
 <br>
 <br>
 264 AA's, virtually every good / even semi decent AA there is, INCLUDING Weapon Affinity 5 AND Pet Crits.
 <br>
 <br>
 The character is fully ele flagged, Time flagged, KT flagged, Emp Ssra / VT keyed, ST keyed, Howling Stones (Charasis), and just needs Uqua to finish your Qvic flag.
 <br>
 <br>
 Notable equipment: Bloodstone Sword, the new leet SK weapon from GoD and a dps dream for an SK, Aegis of Blackscales, the shield greater than SoS, THREE forms of shielding with the usual assorted uber stats. The obvious Cudgel of Venemous Hatred, a soloing SK's dream. A very leet adventurer's stone, over 14,000 ldon points. 
 <br>
 <br>
 <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=902949">Full gear can be seen here.</a>
 <br>
 <br>
 Notable items include: Wood Elf Illusion crown, SK pet weapon (Very rare, one of the only on the server, and credited to this character by Allakhazam, watch your pets be spammed with WA5, and watch them crit for near 200 with pet crits), OT gate hammer (never buy another gate potion again), Staff of Endless Adventure, Blood Ember Breastplate (Clickable hp/magic resist, great for dueling, which is what my reputation is prided on)
 <br>
 <br>
 Notable spells: All spells up to GoD, INCLUDING the very rare GoD Black Shroud spell. A self only lifetap proc buff for 270, which IS affected by Weapon Affinity 5 and often crits for 540, and crit heals for 1080. That's up to 1080 mana free healing, along with CoVH you can easily solo dragons such as Talendor and Trakanon, as I have many times. Other spells include the rare Augmentation of Death, 65% pet haste 55str, a very noticeable difference in soloing and pvp. Also Spell: Deathly Temptation, very rare Luclin spell, in times when you want to be a white skeleton, opposed to a rusted. (Totally worth the time and trouble of attending every Rhag raid, the only mob it drops from !/sarcasm)
 <br>
 <br>
 The reason for parting with this character is my growing disinterest with Everquest's end game.
 <br>
 <br>
 If you are an employee of SoE or its subdivisions you are barred from bidding on this auction.
 <br>
 <br>
 I am selling my time I have spent on optimizing this character for maximum raid efficiency.
 <br>
 <br>
 I am the original owner, and the sell is as-is, I will not hassle with server transfers, if you are bidding on this you should have the money to spend for one month of Legends and transfer that way.
 <br>
 <br>
 Subscription is paid for for another 2-3 months.
 <br>
 <br>
 Money orders, verified pay-pal (money is in my banking account),  or cash only.
 <br>
 <br>
 Bid with confidence.
